From 580102e2947b1cf5128f2967c8e418bcb6e3edfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: janhdonline <janhdonline@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:59:52 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Apply neumorphic soft-UI theme to dashboard and shared
 components

Re-skin the UI in the approved neumorphic (soft-UI) direction:
soft extruded surfaces with dual shadows, pill shapes, blue-to-purple
gradient accents, and tactile press interactions.

- globals.css: neu / neu-sm / neu-inset / neu-press utilities,
  gradient accent tokens, staggered rise-in, reduced-motion guard,
  print-safe shadows
- card, stat-card, button, badge, input, dropdown, data-table:
  neumorphic surfaces, pill buttons/inputs, gradient primary actions
- sidebar, topbar, global-search: gradient active states, inset search
- dashboard: neu quick-action pills, gradient range selector,
  violet chart palette (layout unchanged)

Specs: OPENCODE_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md (23 phases),
UI_DESIGN_DIRECTION.md, ui-concepts/ previews.
